# __name__

`__name__` is one product in one Rush project. The Rush name is `@vprprudhvi/__name__`. It has one `package.json`. `rush new --project __name__` made it.

Read [projects/CLAUDE.md](../CLAUDE.md) and [REVIEW.md](REVIEW.md) before you change it.

## Parts

A new project has no parts. Add each part that the project needs, in any order:

```sh
node common/scripts/install-run-rush.js add-part --project __name__ --part node   # Fastify server in src/api, Bruno collection in bruno/
node common/scripts/install-run-rush.js add-part --project __name__ --part web    # Next.js app in web/, Playwright specs in web/e2e/
node common/scripts/install-run-rush.js add-part --project __name__ --part infra  # CDK app in bin/ and lib/
```

When an endpoint needs a request or response shape, write the Zod schema in `src/contracts/`.

## Phases

Rush runs each phase through the `_phase:*` script of `package.json`. Each script runs `scripts/phase.mjs`. The script finds the parts by their folders and runs the steps of each part. When a step fails, the phase stops and the message names the part.

Run the phases from the repo root:

```sh
node common/scripts/install-run-rush.js verify --to @vprprudhvi/__name__
```
